---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.name}: Business Analyst turned Power Platform and AI developer for legal operations.`}>
  <section class="wrap page prose">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      I'm a Business Analyst at a large IP law firm, moving into hands-on development with
      Power Automate, Power Apps, Power BI, and Copilot agents. My focus is legal operations:
      the intake, data, and hand-offs that keep matters moving.
    </p>
    <p>
      Coming from the BA side means I start with the process, not the tool. I gather requirements
      with the people doing the work, design the solution, build and test it, and support it in
      production.
    </p>
    <h2>Recent work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Designed and built a Forms-to-SQL automation for IP Operations that has processed close to 10,000 staffing update requests.</li>
      <li>Helped implement the firm's intranet on Infodash and built Power Automate flows for the Marketing team on it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <a class="btn primary" href={site.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Connect on LinkedIn</a>
      {site.resumePdf && <a class="btn" href={site.resumePdf}>Résumé (PDF)</a>}
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .page { padding-top: 3rem; }
  .btn { margin: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0 0; }
</style>
